                                                "sense_id": "1ad915c4-5735-31f3-897a-0276f29d1d14",
                                                "text": "The cost of the Mendip line had, however, bankrupted the S.D.R. [Somerset & Dorset Railway], and it was leased to the two larger companies for 999 years in 1875, and named the Somerset & Dorset Joint Railway."
                                            }
                                        ]
